Comment: 0,0:02:54.52,0:02:56.38,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,全神贯注
Comment: 0,0:02:56.38,0:03:03.30,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,保持警惕 直到你看见真实世界
Comment: 0,0:03:03.30,0:03:05.54,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,抓住机会
Comment: 0,0:03:05.54,0:03:09.56,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,直到你终结游戏 答案才会浮现
Comment: 0,0:03:09.56,0:03:12.52,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,你必须亲自出马
Comment: 0,0:03:14.15,0:03:15.69,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,是时候觉醒了
Comment: 0,0:03:15.69,0:03:21.45,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,是时候去寻找被隐藏至深的真相
Comment: 0,0:03:21.45,0:03:25.58,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,你准备好倒计时了吗
Comment: 0,0:03:25.60,0:03:28.20,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,你知道未来无定数
Comment: 0,0:03:28.24,0:03:34.08,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,但我们的选择至关重要
Comment: 0,0:03:34.79,0:03:37.70,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,前路漫漫 未来似乎不堪一击
Comment: 0,0:03:37.70,0:03:45.18,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,真相也只会让你窒息
Comment: 0,0:00:57.90,0:00:57.90,Screen,,0,0,0,,=== OPEN ===
Comment: 1,0:02:54.52,0:02:56.38,OPEN,,0,0,0,karaoke,Open up your senses
Comment: 1,0:02:56.38,0:03:03.30,OPEN,,0,0,0,karaoke,Keep your guard up 'till you see the real world
Comment: 1,0:03:03.30,0:03:05.54,OPEN,,0,0,0,karaoke,Gotta take your chances
Comment: 1,0:03:05.54,0:03:09.56,OPEN,,0,0,0,karaoke,You won't find your answers 'till you end the game
Comment: 1,0:03:09.56,0:03:12.52,OPEN,,0,0,0,karaoke,With your own hands
Comment: 1,0:03:14.15,0:03:15.69,OPEN,,0,0,0,karaoke,It's about time we wake up
Comment: 1,0:03:15.69,0:03:21.45,OPEN,,0,0,0,karaoke,Time we start to see the truth hidden beneath
Comment: 1,0:03:21.45,0:03:25.58,OPEN,,0,0,0,karaoke,Are you ready for the countdown
Comment: 1,0:03:25.60,0:03:28.20,OPEN,,0,0,0,karaoke,You see the future's never certain
Comment: 1,0:03:28.24,0:03:34.08,OPEN,,0,0,0,karaoke,But it's governed by the choices that we make
Comment: 1,0:03:34.79,0:03:37.70,OPEN,,0,0,0,karaoke,You're standing on a fragile future
Comment: 1,0:03:37.70,0:03:45.18,OPEN,,0,0,0,karaoke,And the truth will take your breath away
Comment: 0,0:00:57.90,0:00:57.90,Screen,,0,0,0,,=== END ===
